  "manifesto": {
    "sectionLabel": "§ 01 / MANIFESTO",
    "sublabel": "THE FOUNDATIONAL CLASSROOM",
    "thesisPrefix": "We treat information as a ",
    "thesisAccent": "structured, living landscape",
    "thesisSuffix": " — the summit as the foundational classroom for the next century of intelligence.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Cross Future AI Summit is hosted by Cross Future Hub, a non-profit guiding tech enthusiasts through key trends. As demand for large AI models and high-performance computing accelerates, AI data centers are reshaping the landscape of power infrastructure.",
      "The integration of ultra-high-density computing loads introduces systemic challenges across grid capacity, power quality, supply reliability, and energy dispatch. This workshop convenes leaders to explore the technical pathways, application scenarios, and collaboration opportunities shaping AI data-center resilience."
    ],
